OL,3,AFamily of murdered Stacy Hunter say new
OL,4,Amisogyny bill would not have protected
OL,5,Aher
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe family of Stacy Hunter has called
OL,8,Ffor immediate action to protect victims
OL,9,Fof domestic abuse, after plans for a
OL,10,Fmisogyny bill were announced by the
OL,11,FScottish government.
OL,13,FFirst Minister John Swinney announced
OL,14,Fplans to recognise misogyny as a
OL,15,F"distinct form of prejudice and abuse"
OL,16,Fduring his programme for government on
OL,17,FTuesday, alongside a public health
OL,18,Fcampaign to target toxic male
OL,19,Fbehaviour.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
