OL,3,AFamily of murdered Stacy Hunter say new
OL,4,Amisogyny bill would not have protected
OL,5,Aher
OL,6,
OL,7,FStacy was murdered by her estranged
OL,8,Fhusband, Jim Mair, at her home near
OL,9,FHouston in Refrewshire in July. He was
OL,10,Fon bail for attacking her. His body was
OL,11,Ffound nearby.
OL,13,FHer family is calling for tougher
OL,14,Faction on offenders.
